msgid "Guess the 3D layout and shape from the file name and picture size."
msgstr "根据文件名和画面尺寸猜测 3D 布局和形状。"

msgid "Each eye is squeezed to half width or height in the file: stretch it."
msgstr "文件中每只眼睛被压缩到一半宽度或高度：将其拉伸。"

msgid "Swap left and right if the 3D looks inside out or hurts."
msgstr "如果 3D 看起来里外颠倒或让眼睛不适，交换左右。"

msgid "Open every file in this folder with this mode."
msgstr "用此模式打开此文件夹中的每个文件。"

msgid "Forget the mode set for this folder."
msgstr "忘记为此文件夹设置的模式。"

msgid "How wide the fisheye lens was. Wrong: straight lines bend."
msgstr "鱼眼镜头的视野有多宽。设置错误时直线会弯曲。"

msgid "How wide each lens sees. Wrong: things double at the join."
msgstr "每个镜头的视野有多宽。设置错误时接缝处会出现重影。"

msgid "Slides the back picture sideways until the two halves meet at the join."
msgstr "左右移动后方画面，直到两半在接缝处对齐。"

msgid "Moves the whole 3D picture nearer or farther. Use it if 3D strains your eyes."
msgstr "把整个 3D 画面移近或移远。如果 3D 让眼睛疲劳，请使用它。"

msgid "Keep this depth for this file only."
msgstr "此深度只用于此文件。"

msgid "Fades the sides of 3D, so the frame does not cut what comes out."
msgstr "淡化 3D 画面的两侧，让画框不会切断凸出的内容。"

msgid "How wide the screen is."
msgstr "屏幕有多宽。"

msgid "How far away the screen is."
msgstr "屏幕有多远。"

msgid "Moves the screen up or down."
msgstr "把屏幕上移或下移。"

msgid "Bends the screen around you. 100 % wraps it evenly around your seat."
msgstr "让屏幕环绕你弯曲。100 % 时均匀环绕你的座位。"

msgid "Enlarges the picture inside the screen (crops the edges)."
msgstr "在屏幕内放大画面（裁掉边缘）。"

msgid "How much of your view the screen fills, whatever its distance."
msgstr "无论距离多远，屏幕占你视野的多少。"

msgid "The screen comes back in front of you after you look away."
msgstr "你转开视线后，屏幕会回到你面前。"

msgid "Turns the screen to face you when you lie back (this session)."
msgstr "你躺下时，把屏幕转向你（仅本次）。"

msgid "Shows the whole picture again."
msgstr "重新显示整个画面。"

msgid "Finds black bars above and below the film and removes them."
msgstr "找到影片上下的黑边并去掉。"

msgid "Without bars, widen the screen."
msgstr "去掉黑边后，加宽屏幕。"

msgid "Tilts a 180° or 360° picture up or down if the camera was not level."
msgstr "如果拍摄时相机不水平，把 180° 或 360° 画面向上或向下倾斜。"

msgid "Turns a 180° or 360° picture if the horizon is crooked."
msgstr "如果地平线歪斜，旋转 180° 或 360° 画面。"

msgid "Removes the pitch and roll corrections."
msgstr "去掉俯仰和横滚校正。"

msgid "Lighter or darker overall."
msgstr "整体更亮或更暗。"

msgid "More or less difference between light and dark."
msgstr "明暗差别更大或更小。"

msgid "More or less colour. 0 is black and white."
msgstr "颜色更多或更少。0 为黑白。"

msgid "Lighter or darker mid tones, without changing black and white."
msgstr "中间调更亮或更暗，黑白不变。"

msgid "Makes dark scenes easier to see by lifting the darkest parts."
msgstr "提亮最暗的部分，让暗场景更容易看清。"

msgid "Crisper edges. Too much makes a halo around them."
msgstr "边缘更清晰。过多会在边缘周围产生光晕。"

msgid "Hides the steps in dark gradients. Too much softens faint detail."
msgstr "隐藏暗部渐变中的色阶。过多会让细微的细节变柔和。"

msgid "Removes comb lines from old TV or DVD video. Auto: when needed."
msgstr "去掉老电视或 DVD 视频中的梳状线。自动：需要时启用。"

msgid "Adds the fine noise of projected film."
msgstr "加入胶片放映的细微颗粒。"

msgid "Adds the small sideways wobble of film in an old projector."
msgstr "加入老式放映机中胶片的轻微左右晃动。"

msgid "Brightness, contrast and the rest back to normal."
msgstr "亮度、对比度等全部恢复正常。"

msgid "Fits bright HDR parts to the headset. Off clips them."
msgstr "让 HDR 的高亮部分适应头显。关闭时会被截断。"

msgid "Brighter or darker HDR picture."
msgstr "HDR 画面更亮或更暗。"

msgid "Where the brightest parts start to compress. Higher: more highlight detail."
msgstr "最亮部分从哪里开始压缩。越高：高光细节越多。"

msgid "How bright white is. Lower makes the HDR picture brighter."
msgstr "白色有多亮。越低 HDR 画面越亮。"

msgid "How long each photo shows in the slideshow."
msgstr "幻灯片中每张照片显示多久。"

msgid "How long one photo fades into the next."
msgstr "一张照片淡入下一张用多久。"

msgid "Press at the start and the end of a part to repeat it."
msgstr "在一段的开头和结尾各按一次，即可重复播放这一段。"

msgid "How big the small film in the corner is."
msgstr "角落里的小影片有多大。"

msgid "How loud the film is."
msgstr "影片的音量有多大。"

msgid "Moves the sound earlier or later if lips and voices do not match."
msgstr "如果口型和声音对不上，把声音提前或延后。"

msgid "Opens a test that helps you find the correct offset."
msgstr "打开一个测试，帮你找到正确的偏移。"

msgid "Live streams: shorter is nearer to live, longer has fewer gaps."
msgstr "直播流：越短越接近实时，越长卡顿越少。"

msgid "Loud scenes quieter, quiet speech louder: for late at night."
msgstr "响的场景变轻，轻的对白变响：适合深夜。"

msgid "How strongly night mode evens out loud and quiet."
msgstr "夜间模式拉平响度差别的力度。"

msgid "Makes voices louder. Only for 5.1 sound and more."
msgstr "让人声更响。仅适用于 5.1 及以上声道。"

msgid "Sound from speakers around you and above you, not inside your head."
msgstr "声音来自你周围和上方的扬声器，而不是在你脑袋里。"

msgid "Plays the film's separate bass channel (the .1 of 5.1) too."
msgstr "同时播放影片单独的低音声道（5.1 中的 .1）。"

msgid "The room's echoes and reverb. Off: dry sound, the film only. 100 %: the room as it is built; more: the speakers seem farther."
msgstr "房间的回声与混响。关：干声，只有影片的声音。100 %：房间原本的声音；更多：扬声器听起来更远。"

msgid "The headset sees what the sound plays on: its own speakers or headphones."
msgstr "头显会识别声音从哪里播放：它自己的扬声器还是耳机。"

msgid "Settings for the headset's own speakers."
msgstr "头显自带扬声器的设置。"

msgid "Settings for earbuds or headphones."
msgstr "入耳式耳机或头戴耳机的设置。"

msgid "Hear a sound two ways, pick the better; it then fits your ears."
msgstr "用两种方式听同一个声音，选更好的那个；之后它会更适合你的耳朵。"

msgid "The sound plays on a PC, in time with the picture."
msgstr "声音在电脑上播放，与画面同步。"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Delete host"
msgstr "删除主机"

msgid "Show password"
msgstr "显示密码"

msgid "Add a network host (SMB)"
msgstr "添加网络主机（SMB）"

msgid "Edit network host"
msgstr "编辑网络主机"

