msgid "A picture palace built as a Mediterranean courtyard at dusk: lit windows, iron balconies, a palace gate with an organ, a crescent moon and real stars."
msgstr "一座建成地中海庭院模样的电影宫，正值黄昏：亮灯的窗户、铁艺阳台、带管风琴的宫门、一弯新月和真实的星空。"

msgid "A glass dome on the sea floor: kelp and coral in the floodlights, schools of fish, glowing creatures drawn to the screen, a manta overhead, and in a quiet scene now and then a whale."
msgstr "海底的玻璃圆顶：探照灯下的海带和珊瑚、成群的鱼、被屏幕吸引的发光生物、头顶游过的魔鬼鱼，安静的片段里偶尔还有鲸鱼。"

msgid "The converted cinema: rows on a rake, curtains that part when the film starts, and the house lights going down."
msgstr "改建的电影院：阶梯座位，影片开始时幕布拉开，场灯渐暗。"

msgid "A Moon base's cinema under a geodesic glass dome: Earth turns slowly over the screen, the crater's peaks catch the sun, and the Milky Way comes out when the lights go down."
msgstr "月球基地里网格玻璃圆顶下的影院：地球在银幕上方缓缓转动，环形山的峰顶映着阳光，灯光暗下时银河显现。"

msgid "A drive-in lot at dusk, seen from a convertible's bench seat: the stars come out over the film, moths in the beam, mesas on the horizon."
msgstr "黄昏时的汽车影院，从敞篷车的长椅上观看：星星在影片上方出现，光束里有飞蛾，地平线上是平顶山。"

msgid "A big modern cinema: a steep rake, folded acoustic walls washed in amber, recliners, a starlit ceiling of baffles and a huge curved screen in velvet."
msgstr "大型现代影院：陡峭的阶梯、暖黄灯光洗亮的折板吸音墙、躺椅、星光点点的吸音板天花，以及镶在丝绒中的巨大弧形银幕。"

msgid "An ice hotel's cinema of sawn blocks and carvings under an ice vault: candles glowing inside the ice, hides on ice benches, the polar night and the northern lights outside."
msgstr "冰酒店里的影院，由切割的冰块和冰雕砌成，顶上也是冰：烛光在冰中闪烁，冰凳上铺着兽皮，窗外是极夜和北极光。"

msgid "A canal boat's saloon at walking pace: dusk falls as reeds, willows and a brick bridge slide past the windows, a village's lights come up, and the boat ties up at a lamp-lit wharf with the credits."
msgstr "以步行速度前行的运河船舱：暮色降临，芦苇、柳树和砖砌拱桥从窗外缓缓滑过，村庄的灯火渐次亮起，片尾字幕时船停靠在灯火映照的码头。"

msgid "A Gothic nave at night, the screen in the chancel: piers rising into rib vaults, candles on iron stands and coronae, coloured glass and a rose window in the moonlight."
msgstr "夜晚的哥特式中殿，银幕在圣坛里：束柱升入肋拱，铁架与吊冠上的烛光，月光下的彩色玻璃与玫瑰窗。"

msgid "A palace of culture, 1974: board-marked concrete, two great mosaics that glitter in the screen's light, a field of glowing globes, and snow falling through the open roof."
msgstr "1974年的文化宫：木纹清水混凝土、两幅在银幕光下闪烁的巨幅马赛克、一片发光的球形吊灯，雪花从敞开的屋顶飘落。"

msgid "A pillow fort in a bedroom, 1993: cushions and a bedsheet, fairy lights, rain on the window, and the telly filling the opening."
msgstr "1993年卧室里的枕头堡：靠垫和床单、彩灯、窗上的雨，电视填满了堡的开口。"

msgid "A dream palace in sugared almond colours: inside a great shell, its ribs glowing pink and blue round a sunburst dome, scalloped arches, mirrors, a buttoned balcony, a festoon with a gold fringe."
msgstr "糖衣杏仁色调的梦幻电影宫：置身巨大的贝壳之中，贝肋围绕放射状圆顶泛着粉蓝光芒；扇贝形拱门、镜子、钉扣丝绒楼座，以及缀着金色流苏的花彩幕。"

msgid "An old picture house taken back by nature: half its roof gone to the stars, ivy and ferns, rain into a puddle that gives back the film."
msgstr "被大自然收回的老影院：半个屋顶已向星空敞开，常春藤和野草，雨水落进映着影片的水洼。"

msgid "A summer cinema on an Athens roof: director's chairs on terracotta tiles, bougainvillea, strings of bulbs, the picture painted on a blind wall, a floodlit temple on its hill, the city all round."
msgstr "雅典屋顶上的夏日露天影院：赤陶地砖上的导演椅、三角梅、一串串灯泡、画在山墙上的银幕、山上灯火通明的神庙，四周是整座城市。"

msgid "A tired multiplex screen, 1983: plasterboard, a swirly carpet, a broken seat, smoke in the beam and a worn print."
msgstr "1983年一间疲惫的多厅影院放映厅：石膏板墙、旋涡花纹地毯、一个坏座位、光束里的烟雾和一卷磨损的拷贝。"

msgid "A collector's private cinema in the hills, 1962: walnut and brass, a slow fire on a floating hearth, the pool glowing outside the glass, the city's lights below, a painting that rises off the screen."
msgstr "1962年山间收藏家的私人影院：胡桃木与黄铜，悬空壁炉里的慢火，玻璃外发光的泳池，山下城市的灯火，一幅画从银幕前升起。"

msgid "A shopfront picture house, 1906: a pressed tin ceiling, folding chairs, gas lamps and a dusty beam from the tin booth."
msgstr "1906年的店面电影院：压花锡板天花板、折叠椅、煤气灯，铁皮放映间射出满是尘埃的光束。"

msgid "A streamline cinema, 1937: coves that glow and change colour, a stepped proscenium round a rising sun, faience bands round the hall, an organ that rises from the pit, a festoon."
msgstr "1937年的流线型影院：发光变色的灯槽、环绕旭日的阶梯式台口、环绕大厅的釉面砖带、从乐池升起的管风琴和一道花彩幕布。"

msgid "The first television, 1930: a small glowing picture in a cabinet, the chair pulled up close."
msgstr "1930年最早的电视：柜子里一块发光的小画面，椅子拉得很近。"

msgid "A drawing room in 1937: a tall cabinet whose lid holds a mirror, the picture seen in the mirror, a marble fireplace and a tea tray."
msgstr "1937年的客厅：一个高高的柜子，盖子里装着镜子，画面在镜子里看，还有大理石壁炉和茶盘。"

msgid "Coronation day, June 1953: every chair in the house round one small set, bunting across the ceiling, sandwiches and tea, rain at the window."
msgstr "1953年6月的加冕日：家里所有的椅子都围着一台小电视，天花板下挂着彩旗，有三明治和茶，窗外下着雨。"

msgid "A living room in 1966: the rented set on splayed legs with its channel dial, a teak sideboard, an orange settee."
msgstr "1966年的起居室：租来的电视机立在外撇的腿上，带着换台旋钮，木质餐边柜，橙色沙发。"

msgid "The first colour set, 1972: the television in the corner and the chairs in a row."
msgstr "1972年第一台彩电：电视放在角落，椅子排成一排。"

msgid "A portable on a desk, 1983: a small screen up close, as a home computer's was."
msgstr "1983年书桌上的便携电视：小屏幕就在眼前，就像当年家用电脑的屏幕。"

msgid "A family set in 1987: a rented tape, the settee across from the television."
msgstr "1987年的家庭电视：一盘租来的录像带，沙发正对着电视。"

msgid "A bedroom telly in 1993, seen from a bean bag on the floor."
msgstr "1993年卧室里的电视，从地上的懒人沙发看过去。"

msgid "A lounge in 2002: a big deep rear projection set filling the end of the room, a leather sofa, a glass coffee table."
msgstr "2002年的客厅：一台又大又深的背投电视占满房间的一头，皮沙发，玻璃茶几。"

msgid "The first flat screen, 2005: a wide picture on a stand, the sofa further back."
msgstr "2005年第一台平板电视：架子上一块宽屏，沙发离得更远。"

msgid "A calm bare room some day to come: no set at all, a part of the wall wakes and becomes the picture."
msgstr "未来某一天一间安静空旷的房间：根本没有电视机，墙的一部分醒来，变成画面。"

msgid "A living room today: a thin panel on a dark wall, a soundbar under it, a floor lamp by the sofa. The film at its best."
msgstr "今天的起居室：深色墙上一块薄薄的屏幕，下面是条形音箱，沙发旁一盏落地灯。影片在这里最好看。"

msgid "Nothing but black and a mirror floor that gives back the film, with a ripple where you move."
msgstr "只有黑暗和一面映出影片的镜面地板，你移动的地方会泛起波纹。"

msgid "Clouds"
msgstr "云"

msgid "Organ before the film"
msgstr "影片开始前的管风琴"

msgid "Lights outside in the film"
msgstr "放映时的外部灯光"

#. The Bathysphere's setting: how often the whale comes.
msgid "Whale"
msgstr "鲸鱼"

msgid "House lights in the film"
msgstr "放映中的场灯"

#. The Crater's setting: how fast Earth turns in the sky.
msgid "Earth's speed"
msgstr "地球转速"

msgid "Window speaker"
msgstr "车窗扬声器"

msgid "Starlight ceiling"
msgstr "星光天花"

msgid "Aurora"
msgstr "极光"

msgid "Candles"
msgstr "蜡烛"

msgid "Snow"
msgstr "雪"

msgid "Rain on the window"
msgstr "窗上的雨"

#. Pillow Fort 1993: a room setting.
msgid "The telly fills the opening"
msgstr "电视填满入口"

msgid "The telly's own speaker"
msgstr "电视机自带的扬声器"

msgid "Weather"
msgstr "天气"

msgid "Floodlights on the hill"
msgstr "山上的泛光灯"

msgid "Weave and tilt"
msgstr "画面抖动与倾斜"

msgid "Wall lamps in the film"
msgstr "影片中的壁灯"

msgid "Player piano"
msgstr "自动钢琴"

msgid "Cove colours"
msgstr "灯槽颜色"

msgid "Lines in the picture"
msgstr "画面线数"

msgid "Fire in the grate"
msgstr "壁炉里的火"

msgid "Snow from the aerial"
msgstr "天线雪花噪点"

msgid "Wrong way round"
msgstr "左右颠倒"

msgid "Aerial lead noise"
msgstr "天线连接线噪点"

msgid "Bold lines"
msgstr "粗扫描线"

msgid "The tape"
msgstr "录像带"

msgid "Weather at the window"
msgstr "窗外天气"

msgid "Fairy lights over the telly"
msgstr "电视上方的彩灯"

msgid "Lamp in the set"
msgstr "机内投影灯"

msgid "Backlight bleed"
msgstr "背光漏光"

msgid "Stars in the window"
msgstr "窗外的星星"

msgid "Floor lamp in the film"
msgstr "影片中的落地灯"

msgid "Ripple"
msgstr "波纹"

msgid "How much of the open sky the clouds cover. They catch the film's light."
msgstr "露天天空中云的多少。云会映出影片的光。"

msgid "The theatre organ behind the grilles plays for a minute or so when the room opens and between films, and finishes as the film starts."
msgstr "格栅后的剧院管风琴会在放映厅开场时和两部影片之间演奏一分钟左右，并在影片开始时收尾。"

#. The Bathysphere's settings: how deep the dome lies, and the floodlights in the film.
msgid "How deep the dome lies: sunlit shallows with shafts of light and caustics, the blue twilight, or the black abyss where only the lamps and what glows show."
msgstr "圆顶所在的深度：有光柱和焦散光纹的阳光浅海、蓝色的暮光层，或只有灯光和发光生物可见的漆黑深渊。"

msgid "How bright the floodlights on the sea floor stay once the film has started. Before the film they are full."
msgstr "影片开始后，照向海底的探照灯保持的亮度。影片开始前为全亮。"

msgid "How often a whale swims past behind the screen in a quiet scene."
msgstr "安静的场景中，鲸鱼从屏幕后方游过的频率。"

msgid "How bright the house lamps stay once the film has started."
msgstr "影片开始后场灯保持的亮度。"

msgid "How fast Earth turns in the sky. At 1 x it turns once in two hours, about once a film."
msgstr "地球在天空中转动的速度。1 倍时两小时转一圈，大约一部影片转一圈。"

msgid "The film's sound from the little speaker hung on the car's window: tinny, mono, a little rattle."
msgstr "影片声音来自挂在车窗上的小扬声器：单薄、单声道，略带杂音。"

msgid "Pinholes of light in the ceiling between the baffles."
msgstr "吸音板之间的天花上点点针孔光。"

msgid "The northern lights in the window and the skylights: lively before the film and swelling in its quiet scenes, glowing all the time, or staying away."
msgstr "窗外和天窗里的北极光：影片开始前活跃，在安静的场景中增强；或一直发光，或不出现。"

msgid "None: the church by moonlight and the film alone. A few: two candle stands either side of the screen, the coronae over the nave and the votive lights. Many: four stands a side."
msgstr "无：只有月光下的教堂和影片。少量：银幕两侧各两座烛台，中殿上方的吊冠和许愿烛。多：每侧四座烛台。"

msgid "Snow through the open back of the roof, over the birches outside."
msgstr "雪从屋顶敞开的后部飘进来，也落在外面的树林里。"

msgid "Rain on the glass and in the street, a drizzle, rain that comes and goes, or a dry night."
msgstr "玻璃上和街上的雨、毛毛雨、时下时停的雨，或无雨的夜晚。"

#. Pillow Fort 1993: the setting's description.
msgid "The telly stands just beyond the fort's opening and fills it; off, it is back on its chest of drawers across the room."
msgstr "电视就放在枕头堡入口外，正好填满入口；关闭时，它回到房间另一头的抽屉柜上。"

msgid "The film's sound as the telly's small speaker gives it: thin, boxy and in mono."
msgstr "影片的声音如同电视机的小扬声器播放：单薄、发闷，且为单声道。"

msgid "Rain through the broken roof, a misty drizzle, a clear night, or each in turn."
msgstr "雨从破屋顶落下、带雾的细雨、晴朗的夜晚，或依次轮换。"

msgid "How brightly the temple on the hill is lit. At the bottom: dark."
msgstr "山上的神庙被照亮的程度。拉到最低：熄灭。"

msgid "How much the worn print drifts in the gate, and how crooked the projector stands. At the bottom: steady and straight."
msgstr "旧拷贝在片门中漂移的程度，以及放映机歪斜的程度。拉到最低：稳定且端正。"

msgid "How bright the brass wall lamps stay once the film has started."
msgstr "影片开始后黄铜壁灯保持的亮度。"

msgid "A player piano by the screen plays along with the film. Off: no piano."
msgstr "银幕旁的自动钢琴随影片弹奏。关：没有钢琴。"

msgid "The cove lights' colour before the film. Changing: they move through the colours. In the film they take the film's colour."
msgstr "影片开始前灯槽灯光的颜色。变换：在各种颜色之间轮换。影片放映时它们取影片的颜色。"

msgid "The set drew its picture in 30 glowing lines. More lines show the film more clearly than it ever could."
msgstr "这台电视用 30 条发光的线绘出画面。线数越多，影片就越清晰，远胜当年。"

msgid "A coal fire burns in the grate. Off: the grate is cold and the set's glow lights the room."
msgstr "壁炉里燃着煤火。关：壁炉是冷的，只有电视的光照亮房间。"

msgid "Snow on the picture from a weak signal on the roof aerial. At the bottom: a clean picture."
msgstr "屋顶天线信号弱，画面上出现雪花。拉到最低：画面干净。"

msgid "The picture as the mirror shows it, left and right swapped. Off: the set turns it round."
msgstr "画面如镜中所见，左右互换。关闭：由电视机把它转回来。"

msgid "A coal fire burns in the grate."
msgstr "壁炉里燃着煤火。"

msgid "A coal fire burns in the grate, and the cat likes the hearth."
msgstr "壁炉里燃着煤火，猫喜欢待在炉前。"

msgid "How bright the wall lamps stay once the film has started."
msgstr "影片开始后壁灯保持的亮度。"

msgid "A little snow from the aerial. At the bottom: a clean picture."
msgstr "天线带来一点雪花。拉到最低：画面干净。"

msgid "The set's colour knob. New colour sets were often turned up rich and warm."
msgstr "电视的色彩旋钮。新的彩色电视常被调得浓郁温暖。"

msgid "The computer and the telly share the aerial lead, and a little noise comes with it."
msgstr "电脑和电视共用天线连接线，因此带来一点噪点。"

msgid "The dark gaps between the picture's lines, as a small portable showed them close up."
msgstr "画面扫描线之间的暗缝，就像近看小型便携电视时那样。"

msgid "How many times the tape has been played: noise, smeared colour and the tear at the bottom."
msgstr "录像带被播放过多少次：噪点、模糊的色彩和底部的撕裂。"

msgid "Rain on the window, a clear night, or each in turn."
msgstr "雨打窗户、晴朗的夜晚，或两者轮流。"

msgid "How bright the fairy lights over the telly are. At the bottom: off."
msgstr "电视上方彩灯的亮度。拉到最低：关。"

msgid "The projection lamp inside the set: an old lamp makes a dimmer picture."
msgstr "电视机里的投影灯：灯用旧了，画面就更暗。"

msgid "The early panel's backlight glowing through the dark scenes, most at the corners."
msgstr "早期平板电视的背光在暗场景中透出，角落最明显。"

msgid "How many stars the night shows through the long window."
msgstr "长窗外的夜空里有多少星星。"

msgid "How bright the floor lamp by the sofa stays once the film has started."
msgstr "影片开始后沙发旁落地灯保持的亮度。"

msgid "A faint ring on the floor where you move. At the bottom: none."
msgstr "你移动时地面上出现的淡淡波纹。拉到最低：无。"

msgid "Sunlit shallows"
msgstr "阳光浅海"

msgid "Twilight"
msgstr "暮光层"

msgid "Abyss"
msgstr "深渊"

